{"id":"30aebaf6dc4184af","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-homotopy-cofiber.md","title":"Homotopy Cofiber","display":"df-homotopy-cofiber — Homotopy Cofiber","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-homotopy-cofiber","aliases":["58-df-homotopy-cofiber"],"display":"df-homotopy-cofiber — Homotopy Cofiber","depends_on":["[[58-df-mapping-cone]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-homotopy-cofiber"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-homotopy-cofiber</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-homotopy-cofiber — Homotopy Cofiber"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4397ca2cdf99ab61\" href=\"?note=4397ca2cdf99ab61\" title=\"58-df-mapping-cone\">58-df-mapping-cone</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i:A\\to X\">\\(i:A\\to X\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_i\">\\(C_i\\)</span> (homotopy-cofiber parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MappingCone}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MappingCone}_S\\)</span> (mapping-cone predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4397ca2cdf99ab61\" href=\"?note=4397ca2cdf99ab61\" title=\"58-df-mapping-cone\">58-df-mapping-cone</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HomotopyCofiber}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HomotopyCofiber}_S\\)</span> (homotopy cofiber predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homotopy\\text{-}cofiber} \\vdash \\mathrm{HomotopyCofiber}_S(C_i,i,A,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{MappingCone}_S(C_i,i,A,X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homotopy\\text{-}cofiber} \\vdash \\mathrm{HomotopyCofiber}_S(C_i,i,A,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{MappingCone}_S(C_i,i,A,X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The homotopy cofiber of a map is its mapping cone; reusing the canonical predicate prevents two incompatible quotient conventions.</li>\n<li>Suspension <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma X\">\\(\\Sigma X\\)</span> is cofiber of inclusion <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X \\to CX\">\\(X \\to CX\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Blakers–Massey theorem gives connectivity estimates.</li>\n<li>Fibrations/cofibrations form factorization of any map.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-mapping-cone","status":"resolved","id":"4397ca2cdf99ab61","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-mapping-cone]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-mapping-cone","status":"resolved","id":"4397ca2cdf99ab61","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MappingCone}_S$ (mapping-cone predicate, see [[58-df-mapping-cone]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"i:A\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"C_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MappingCone}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HomotopyCofiber}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homotopy\\text{-}cofiber} \\vdash \\mathrm{HomotopyCofiber}_S(C_i,i,A,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{MappingCone}_S(C_i,i,A,X)","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma X","display":false},{"tex":"X \\to CX","display":false}],"bytes":994,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-642","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-homotopy-cofiber.md|58-df-homotopy-cofiber]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["4397ca2cdf99ab61"]}